From 64eb2bb0a8d964e96a7a139cdcb900a12ae4878c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiao Han <hanxiao@live.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 18:09:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] platform/x86: oxpec: Use data-driven EC profiles

Replace board-specific register switch statements with immutable EC profiles.

Point DMI driver_data directly at each profile and validate mandatory
registers and paired optional fields once during driver initialization.
This keeps existing supported-board behavior while making incomplete
profiles fail closed before any EC access.

Signed-off-by: Xiao Han <hanxiao@live.com>
